    "Id": "mechdef_aries_ARS-E",
    "Name": "Aries E",
    "Details": "Configuration E features Improved ATMs on both arms for strong missile strikes, supported by five Medium Pulse Lasers on each torso for balanced energy fire. An ER Large Laser in the head adds precision. Ammo for the iATM is distributed across left torso and legs. The mech includes a Targeting Computer and Angel ECM Suite for enhanced accuracy and defense. Mobility is boosted with a Supercharger and Jump Jets. Heat management relies on 17 double heat sinks, ensuring sustained combat effectiveness in varied battle conditions.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.19</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#0064e6>Used with permission from Aries Games and Miniatures.</color></b>",
